    ) : -1;
);


/*
   The drag of a cell of value : a potentiometer (the convention of CMGS for the cells holding a value) :
       left drag   horizontal : coarse, the whole range [lo, hi] in px pixels ; vertical : fine (1/10, up = more) ;
                   the cross of the cell : in its column (the cell included), only the fine adjustment (the vertical
                   moves) ; in its row, out of the column, only the coarse one (the horizontal moves) ; elsewhere both
       Shift + left clic : the reset (the host does it ; no drag starts with Shift) ; the left clic alone does nothing ;
       right clic : a menu (the host)
